# React 19 — Submit Event Rule

Use `React.SubmitEvent<HTMLFormElement>` (or `SubmitEventHandler`) for `<form onSubmit>`.
Never use `React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>` for submit handlers.

Rule to remember: **Submit uses SubmitEvent**.

```tsx
// ✅ Good
const handleSubmit = async (e: React.SubmitEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {
  e.preventDefault();
};

// ❌ Bad
const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {
  e.preventDefault();
};
```
